## 10. Risks & Open Questions

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Backlink API cost scales badly with audit volume | Weekly caching (see 6.2); consider whether off-page is a Pro/Enterprise-only tier feature vs. included for all plans |
| Off-page data quality varies significantly between providers (Moz DA ≠ Ahrefs DR ≠ SEMrush's own metric) | Document clearly in the report that DA is provider-specific and not a universal Google ranking factor — avoid client confusion/disputes |
| Keyword density check needs a "target keyword" input per page, which the current audit flow doesn't collect | **Open question:** does the client provide target keywords per page, or does the tool need a keyword-suggestion step first? Needs a decision before building 6.1 #5. |
| Readability scoring (`textstat`) is English-only by default | Fine for now given your target markets include Pakistan/South Asia sites in English; flag if non-English audit support becomes a requirement |

